                  <rdf:li>ï»¿ï»¿Oticon Intentâ„¢ miniBTE R combines two fitting levels in one rechargeable device. Fitting level 85 and 105 can be configured directly in the fitting software. It is built on the Siriusâ„¢ platform, powered by Oticon BrainHearingâ„¢ technology and supports BluetoothÂ® LE Audio, Bluetooth Low Energy, and Auracastâ„¢ broadcast. It enables hands-free communication and direct streaming for iPhone, iPad, Mac and select Androidâ„¢ devices.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿WARNING: No modification of this equipment is allowed.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Apple, the Apple logo, iPhone, iPad, Mac and the Mac logo are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries. Use of the Made for Apple badge means that an accessory has &#xA;been designed to connect specifically to the Apple product(s) identified in the badge and has been certified by the developer to meet Apple performance standards. Apple is not responsible for the operation of this device or its compliance with safety and regulatory standards. Androidâ„¢ is a trademark of Google LLC. The BluetoothÂ® word mark and logos are registered trademarks owned by Bluetooth SIG, Inc. The Auracastâ„¢ word mark and logos are trademarks owned by the Bluetooth SIG. Any use of such marks by Demant is under license. Other trademarks and trade names are those &#xA;of their respective owners.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;   &#xA;Hook&#xA;&#xA;Corda miniFit 1.3 mm&#xA;&#xA;Corda miniFit 0.9 mm&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;miniBTE R&#xA;&#xA;miniBTE R&#xA;&#xA;miniBTE R&#xA;Oticon ï»¿ï»¿Intent 1ï»¿ï»¿ | 2 | 3 | 4&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿miniBTE Rï»¿ï»¿&#xA;   &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical dataï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Operating and charging conditions&#xA;Temperature: +5Â°C to +40Â°C (41Â°F to +104Â°F) &#xA;Humidity: 5% to 93% relative humidity, &#xA;non-condensing&#xA;Atmospheric pressure: 700 hPa to 1060 hPaï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Transportation and storage conditions&#xA;Temperature and humidity shall not exceed &#xA;the mentioned limits during transportation &#xA;and storage.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Transport&#xA;Temperature: -20Â°C to +60Â°C (-4Â°F to +140Â°F) &#xA;Humidity: 5% to 93% relative humidity, &#xA;non-condensing&#xA;Atmospheric pressure: 700 hPa to 1060 hPaï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Storage&#xA;Temperature: -20Â°C to +30Â°C (-4Â°F to +86Â°F)&#xA;Humidity: 5% to 93% relative humidity, &#xA;non-condensing&#xA;Atmospheric pressure: 700 hPa to 1060 hPaï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿  ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿For information on compatibility, please visit www.oticon.global/compatibilityï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿This hearing aid also comes as DemoFlex with the same technical dataï»¿ï»¿&#xA;Technical features&#xA;&#xA;Accessories&#xA;Auracastâ„¢ broadcast&#xA;BluetoothÂ® LE Audio&#xA;BluetoothÂ® Low Energy&#xA;Contact charging&#xA;Telecoil&#xA;NFMI (Near-Field Magnetic Induction)&#xA;Double push-button&#xA;IP68 rated&#xA;&#xA;Oticon Companion app&#xA;ConnectClip&#xA;TV Adapter 3.0&#xA;EduMic&#xA;Phone Adapter 2.0&#xA;Hook and Corda miniFit&#xA;Oticon Charger miniBTE R&#xA;Oticon Intent 1&#xA;Oticon Intent 2 | 3 | 4&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Feature overviewï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿                                         ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Intent 1&#xA;Intent 2&#xA;Intent 3&#xA;Intent 4&#xA;Speech understanding &amp; listening ease&#xA;MoreSound Intelligenceâ„¢ 3.0&#xA;Level 1&#xA;Level 2&#xA;Level 3&#xA;Level 4&#xA;â€ƒSensor technology&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€”&#xA;â€”&#xA;â€ƒEnvironment classifier&#xA;5 configurations&#xA;5 configurations&#xA;3 configurations&#xA;Not adjustable&#xA;â€ƒVirtual Outer Ear&#xA;3 configurations&#xA;2 configurations&#xA;1 configuration&#xA;1 configuration&#xA;â€ƒSpatial Balancer&#xA;100%&#xA;60%&#xA;60%&#xA;40%&#xA;â€ƒNeural Noise Suppression, Difficult / Easy&#xA;12 dB / 6 dB&#xA;10 dB / 4 dB&#xA;8 dB / 2 dB&#xA;6 dB / 0 dB&#xA;â€ƒSound Enhancer&#xA;3 configurations&#xA;2 configurations&#xA;1 configuration&#xA;1 configuration&#xA;â€ƒWind &amp; Handling Stabilizer&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;MoreSound Amplifierâ„¢ 3.0&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒSuddenSound Stabilizer&#xA;6 configurations&#xA;5 configurations&#xA;4 configurations&#xA;2 configurations&#xA;MoreSound Optimizerâ„¢ &#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒFeedback shieldâ€ƒ&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Spatial Soundâ„¢&#xA;4 estimators&#xA;4 estimators&#xA;4 estimators&#xA;â€”&#xA;Soft Speech Booster&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Frequency lowering, Speech Rescueâ„¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Sound quality&#xA;Clear Dynamics&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€”&#xA;â€”&#xA;Better-Ear Priority&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€”&#xA;Fitting BandwidthÂ¹&#xA;10 kHz&#xA;8 kHz&#xA;8 kHz&#xA;8 kHz&#xA;Power Bass (streaming)&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Processing Channels&#xA;64&#xA;48&#xA;48&#xA;48&#xA;Personalisation &amp; optimised fitting&#xA;Fitting Bands&#xA;24&#xA;20&#xA;18&#xA;14&#xA;Multiple Directionality options&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Adaptation Management&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Fitting Formulas&#xA;VAC+, NAL-NL1/&#xA;NAL-NL2, DSL v5&#xA;VAC+, NAL-NL1/&#xA;NAL-NL2, DSL v5&#xA;VAC+, NAL-NL1/&#xA;NAL-NL2, DSL v5&#xA;VAC+, NAL-NL1/&#xA;NAL-NL2, DSL v5&#xA;Connecting to the world&#xA;Oticon Companion app&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;BluetoothÂ® LE Audio2&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Auracastâ„¢ broadcastÂ²&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Hands-free communicationÂ²&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Direct streamingÂ²&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;ConnectClip&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;EduMic&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Remote Control 3.0&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;TV Adapter 3.0&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Phone Adapter 2.0&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Tinnitus SoundSupportâ„¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;CROS/BiCROS support&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Fitting rangesï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Ear Simulatorï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿1)   Measured with the gain control of the hearing aids set to their full-on position minus 20 dB and with an input SPL of 70 dB. &#xA;This is to obtain a gain response equal to the full-on gain response from e.g. IEC 60118-0:1983+A1:1994 but without influence of feedback.&#xA;2)   Measurement is done in quiescent mode. Expected use time for rechargeable battery depends on use pattern, active feature set, hearing loss, &#xA;sound environment, battery age and use of wireless accessories.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Measured according to IECÂ 60118-0:1983/AMD1:1994, IEC 60118-0:2022, IECÂ 60118-1:1995+AMD1:1998 CSV and IECÂ 60318-4:2010ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical information&#xA;Omnidirectional mode is used &#xA;unless otherwise stated.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿2CC Couplerï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿1)   Measured with the gain control of the hearing aids set to their full-on position minus 20 dB and with an input SPL of 70 dB. &#xA;This is to obtain a gain response equal to the full-on gain response from e.g. IEC 60118-0:1983+A1:1994 but without influence of feedback.&#xA;2)   Measurement is done in quiescent mode. Expected use time for rechargeable battery depends on use pattern, active feature set, hearing loss, &#xA;sound environment, battery age and use of wireless accessories.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Measured according to ANSI S3.22-2024, &#xA;IEC 60118-0:2022 and IECÂ 60318-5:2006ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical information&#xA;Omnidirectional mode is used &#xA;unless otherwise stated.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Oticonï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿Intent 1ï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿miniBTE Rï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Oticonï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿Intent 1ï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿miniBTE Rï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;ï»¿ï»¿www.oticon.globalï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;SBO Hearing A/S&#xA;Kongebakken 9&#xA;DK-2765 SmÃ¸rum&#xA;Denmark&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Headquarters&#xA;Oticon A/S&#xA;Kongebakken 9&#xA;DK-2765 SmÃ¸rum&#xA;Denmarkï»¿ï»¿&#xA;285249UK / 2025.08.04 / v1&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;  &#xA;Life-changing technology signifie &#xA;Des technologies qui changent la vie.&#xA;&#xA;www.oticon.fr&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Hook&#xA;Corda minifitï»¿ï»¿&#