xA;sound environment, battery age and use of wireless accessories.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Measured according to IECÂ 60118-0:1983/AMD1:1994, IEC 60118-0:2022, IECÂ 60118-1:1995+AMD1:1998 CSV and IECÂ 60318-4:2010ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical information&#xA;Omnidirectional mode is used &#xA;unless otherwise stated.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Oticonï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿Intent 2ï»¿ï»¿ | 3 | 4 ï»¿ï»¿miniBTE Rï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿2CC Couplerï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿1)   Measured with the gain control of the hearing aids set to their full-on position minus 20 dB and with an input SPL of 70 dB. &#xA;This is to obtain a gain response equal to the full-on gain response from e.g. IEC 60118-0:1983+A1:1994 but without influence of feedback.&#xA;2)   Measurement is done in quiescent mode. Expected use time for rechargeable battery depends on use pattern, active feature set, hearing loss, &#xA;sound environment, battery age and use of wireless accessories.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Measured according to ANSI S3.22-2024, &#xA;IEC 60118-0:2022 and IECÂ 60318-5:2006ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical information&#xA;Omnidirectional mode is used &#xA;unless otherwise stated.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Oticonï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿Intent 2ï»¿ï»¿ | 3 | 4 ï»¿ï»¿miniBTE Rï»¿ï»¿&#xA;       &#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿85 hook (damped)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Corda miniFit 1.3ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿105 hook (damped)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿105 hook (undamped)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency response (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency response (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;       &#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿85 hook (damped)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Corda miniFit 1.3ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿105 hook (damped)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿105 hook (undamped)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#